James,

Thanks for your prompt reply and the function to solve my question. With a couple of extra lines of code to add the simulated risk ratio to the output, I obtained the needed confidence intervals-

##Working to add RR to simulation output- s.out.2

rr<- s.out.2$qi[[2]]/s.out.2$qi[[1]]#Risk ratio

s.out.2$qi<- list("Risk Ratio"=rr)

print(myci(s.out.2))##CI RR

rr.num<- as.numeric(rr)
mean(rr.num)#RR point est.

Kind regards,

Chris

